"Shows the finer settings in every tab: the mouse buttons, the session sound and glow, the lock screen and screensaver, and display options. Hidden settings keep working as you set them." = "在每個標籤頁顯示更細的設定：滑鼠按鍵、專注的聲音和光暈、鎖定畫面和螢幕保護程式，以及顯示器選項。隱藏後，一切仍按你的設定運作。";
"Plays the glow and the sound once, as at the end of a session." = "像專注結束時那樣，顯示一次光暈並播放一次提示音。";
"The plain display for a while: color and no added warmth. Night Shift is left alone, and all your settings stay." = "暫時顯示無濾鏡畫面：彩色且不疊加暖色。夜覽不受影響，你的所有設定都保留。";
"Shows the supported browsers that are not installed on this Mac." = "顯示這台 Mac 上未安裝的受支援瀏覽器。";
"Shows the thank-you card with ways to support Less Pull, the one that appears after two weeks." = "顯示感謝卡片，其中列出支持 Less Pull 的方式，與兩週後出現的那張相同。";
"Some things need color: a photo app, a video site, a chart. Choose Exception for the app you are in, right from the menu, and change only what should differ. Websites work the same way once the browser extension is connected." = "有些東西需要顏色：照片 App、影片網站、圖表。直接在選單中為目前的 App 選擇「個別設定」，只改需要不同的部分。瀏覽器延伸功能連接後，網站也一樣。";
