"Start a session from the menu: a stretch of focused work with a gentle end. The icon shows the minutes left. At the end comes a warm glow and a soft gong, nothing to click away, and the count goes on so you can see how far you stretch. When you leave, it can call you back once." = "從選單開始專注時段：一段溫和收尾的專注工作。圖像顯示剩餘分鐘。結束時有溫暖的光暈和輕柔的鑼聲，無需關閉任何東西，計數繼續，讓你看到自己延長了多久。你離開時，它可以喚回你一次。";
