"The extension reads the address and title of your tabs, so Less Pull knows which website is in front. Your browser will call this “browsing history”.\n\nIt cannot read or change what is on a page, see what you type, or reach your passwords, cookies or forms. It has no buttons and no network connection of its own; it talks only to the Less Pull app on this Mac. Private tabs are never reported.\n\nWhat is kept: only the website exceptions you save, on this Mac. The address of the site in front is held in memory, never written to disk, overwritten by the next one, and dropped when the browser disconnects or stops reporting." = "延伸功能讀取標籤頁的網址和標題，好讓 Less Pull 知道哪個網站在最前方。瀏覽器會把這稱為「瀏覽記錄」。\n\n它不能讀取或更改頁面內容，看不到你輸入的內容，也接觸不到你的密碼、Cookie 或表單。它沒有按鈕，也沒有自己的網路連線；只與這台 Mac 上的 Less Pull App 通訊。私密瀏覽標籤頁從不回報。\n\n保留的內容：只有你儲存的網站個別設定，存放在這台 Mac 上。最前方網站的網址只保存在記憶體中，從不寫入磁碟，會被下一個覆蓋，並在瀏覽器中斷連接或停止回報時捨棄。";
