"This app is a gift from the universe to you. It has been fully funded by life.\n\nMy future projects and my work are still being developed, and they benefit from any kind of support: a contribution, telling a friend, or whatever you choose. Thanks for being part of life and making it more beautiful for everyone.\n\n— Jiri Arion Rose" = "這個 App 是宇宙送給你的禮物。它的全部費用由生活支付。\n\n我未來的專案和工作仍在成長，任何形式的支持都會有所幫助：一筆贊助、告訴一位朋友，或你選擇的任何方式。謝謝你成為生活的一部分，並讓它對每個人都更美好。\n\n— Jiri Arion Rose";
