"A Control-click or a two-finger tap counts as a right-click. One of the two buttons always opens the menu. The session panel starts a session, or shows the one running. When a session ends, the two buttons swap, so a click reaches the session panel." = "按住 Control 鍵並按一下或兩指輕點算作按右鍵。兩個按鍵中總有一個打開選單。專注面板可以開始專注，或顯示正在進行的專注。專注結束時兩個按鍵互換，按一下即可到達專注面板。";
"Follows what is on it: the app you are using, the app on top of this display, or your defaults. Always your defaults: exceptions do not apply here. Always plain: never gray or warmth here." = "「跟隨其上內容」：你正在用的 App、這台顯示器最上層的 App，或你的預設設定。「一律用預設設定」：個別設定在這裡不生效。「一律無濾鏡」：這裡從不使用灰色或暖色。";
"Which displays a peek reaches while you use this app: the one under the pointer, all of them, or the ones you tick. This works even while the exception is off." = "你使用此 App 時，一瞥作用於哪些顯示器：指標所在的那台、全部，或你勾選的那些。即使個別設定關閉也有效。";
