"With several displays: peek only on the display under the pointer, or on all at once. On one display, a double press keeps just that display plain; press there again to return." = "有多台顯示器時：只在指標所在的顯示器上一瞥，或同時在所有顯示器上。在一台顯示器上按兩下，只讓它保持無濾鏡；在那裡再按一下即恢復。";
"You have %@.\n\n%@\n\nThis update is installed by hand: download it, quit Less Pull, and replace the app in Applications. Your settings and exceptions stay." = "你目前的版本是 %@。\n\n%@\n\n此更新需手動安裝：下載它，結束 Less Pull，然後在「應用程式」檔案夾中取代 App。設定和個別設定保持不變。";
